eel ancillary  or underdeveloped they feel like proper  people even though they are very much  not the focus so ultimately I'm not  gonna say like rush out and see this I'm  not even gonna say you must see the  performance of Remy Malick I say if you  are a fan of Queen I think that you will  enjoy this barring any issues of you  know the actual history of Queen enough  that any deviation is going to distract  or annoy you that might be more of a  deal breaker hard for me to say because  as I said exactly how much they did  deviate I don't really know but I'm  gonna wrap it up there um  Remy Malick maybe deserves to win Best  Actor I'm not gonna say that  definitively cuz I haven't really seen  anybody else who's up for it but I will  say the film doesn't deserve to win Best  Picture  I am glad he's nominated though and I  think the film yeah I think it deserved  the success that it had it may be  getting over praised in some circles but  no solid work I say so  believe me and Rhapsody what you think  about it whatever your thoughts are drop  something down in the comments let's  talk about a whole bunch of stuff to do  buttons links patreon hey I'm beggin now  I'm not really begging but you know it's  helpful there's others links down there  besides for you to check out plus you  know all these I got appeal box all that  stuff it's all down in the description  give it a look or don't you don't have  to it's okay cuz at the end of the day  you're the council  I'm just running the meetings and until  next time this council is it  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

